@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:办理与登记退款</u>\n<u>控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:患者资金</u>" as Funds
participant "<u>:退款办理</u>" as Refund
participant "<u>:患者付款</u>" as Payment
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-26办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-26办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Funds : 恢复既有办理结果(原办理依据)
activate Funds
Funds -> Refund : 提供办理进度(原请求及渠道线索)
activate Refund
Refund --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Refund
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A0 -> B0 : 报告结果仍不明确
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-26办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Funds : 登记结果待核实(原办理、说明)
activate Funds
Funds -> Refund : 保留额度占用(待核实结果)
activate Refund
Refund --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Refund
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A0 -> B0 : 提交渠道核查结论
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-26办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Funds : 确认核查结论(成功或确定失败的证据)
activate Funds
Funds -> Refund : 核实办理结果(实际金额与渠道凭据)
activate Refund
Refund --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Refund
Funds -> Payment : 核对来源可退额(确认扣减或失败释放后余额)
activate Payment
Payment --> Funds : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Payment
Funds --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Funds
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Payment
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
